{"id":"7ceaa450caff8261","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-thm-iwasawa.md","title":"Iwasawa's Theorem","display":"thm-iwasawa — Iwasawa's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-iwasawa","aliases":["58-thm-iwasawa"],"display":"thm-iwasawa — Iwasawa's Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-zp-extension-tower]]","[[58-df-ideal-class-group]]","[[58-df-valuation]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-iwasawa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-iwasawa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-iwasawa — Iwasawa's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee0e6fd2a5876cee\" href=\"?note=ee0e6fd2a5876cee\" title=\"58-df-zp-extension-tower\">58-df-zp-extension-tower</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2a057f83805b06e9\" href=\"?note=2a057f83805b06e9\" title=\"58-df-ideal-class-group\">58-df-ideal-class-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fb569bc36cce327\" href=\"?note=0fb569bc36cce327\" title=\"58-df-valuation\">58-df-valuation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_\\infty,K,p,\\vec K,h\\in V\">\\(K_\\infty,K,p,\\vec K,h\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZpExtensionTower}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZpExtensionTower}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iwasawa} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZpExtensionTower}_S(K_\\infty,K,p,\\vec K)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,\\omega,\\mathbb N)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(h(n)=|\\operatorname{Cl}(\\vec K(n))|)\\to\\exists\\mu,\\lambda\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\nu\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(n_0\\leq n\\to v_p(h(n))=\\mu p^n+\\lambda n+\\nu\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iwasawa} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZpExtensionTower}_S(K_\\infty,K,p,\\vec K)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,\\omega,\\mathbb N)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(h(n)=|\\operatorname{Cl}(\\vec K(n))|)\\to\\exists\\mu,\\lambda\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\nu\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(n_0\\leq n\\to v_p(h(n))=\\mu p^n+\\lambda n+\\nu\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is Iwasawa's class-number growth theorem for a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z_p\">\\(\\mathbb Z_p\\)</span>-extension.</li>\n<li>It governs the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-primary part of the class group, not the entire class number as a pure power of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Iwasawa algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda = \\mathbb{Z}_p[\\![T]\\!]\">\\(\\Lambda = \\mathbb{Z}_p[\\![T]\\!]\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zp-extension-tower","status":"resolved","id":"ee0e6fd2a5876cee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zp-extension-tower]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal-class-group","status":"resolved","id":"2a057f83805b06e9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ideal-class-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-valuation","status":"resolved","id":"0fb569bc36cce327","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-valuation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K_\\infty,K,p,\\vec K,h\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZpExtensionTower}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iwasawa} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZpExtensionTower}_S(K_\\infty,K,p,\\vec K)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,\\omega,\\mathbb N)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(h(n)=|\\operatorname{Cl}(\\vec K(n))|)\\to\\exists\\mu,\\lambda\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\nu\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(n_0\\leq n\\to v_p(h(n))=\\mu p^n+\\lambda n+\\nu\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z_p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda = \\mathbb{Z}_p[\\![T]\\!]","display":false}],"bytes":1079,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4240","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-thm-iwasawa.md|58-thm-iwasawa]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["ee0e6fd2a5876cee","2a057f83805b06e9","0fb569bc36cce327","36d7463d215be751"]}